    "tags": [],
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>(18th Level)</em></p><p><strong>Noise:</strong> +3</p><p>You end the manifestation of a feral god, tulpa, or rogue divine entity.</p><p>The manifestation collapses and cannot reconstitute for a meaningful time (GM discretion).</p><p>This does not erase the entity from existence.<br />It removes its current operational authority.</p><h3>Cost</h3><p>Spend 2+ Surge.</p><h3>Escalation</h3><p>If the entity is Out of Compliance, the shutdown bypasses typical Boss immunity.</p><h3>Pushback</h3><p>This is a jurisdictional incident.</p><p>Expect:</p><ul><li><p>Divine retaliation</p></li><li><p>Political scrutiny</p></li><li><p>Mandate audits</p></li><li><p>Rival Auditor involvement</p></li></ul>",
      "chat": ""
    },
